doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/inEdges(of:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/inEdges(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/outDegree(of:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/outDegree(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/outEdges(of:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/outEdges(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/predecessorIndices(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/predecessors(of:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/source(ofEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/sourceIndex(ofEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/successorIndices(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/successors(of:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/target(ofEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/targetIndex(ofEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/vertex(atIndex:)","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/vertexIndex(of:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/InEdges","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/PredecessorIndices","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/SuccessorIndices","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/Vertex"],"title":"Type Aliases","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/BidirectionalDirectedGraph-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/BidirectionalDirectedGraph","doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedGraph","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DirectedIncidenceGraphView"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Base"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Base"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph","text":"DirectedHypergraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Edges."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Positions "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0 ..< P_s"},{"type":"text","text":" are the source incidences, hyperedge by hyperedge in index"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order and within one in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sourceIndices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"P_s + q"},{"type":"text","text":" is target incidence "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":", in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same order. A per-incidence array is indexed by edge position. A view is a snapshot, so its own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions never change, but they are valid for the hypergraph only until its next mutation:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the view of the mutated hypergraph numbers the incidences afresh (on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inserting one cell shifts every later incidence by one)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The LabeledGraph law."}]},{"type":"text","text":" Every index member reads the base’s rows, shifted where they hold"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hyperedges: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"successorIndices(ofIndex: i)"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"outHyperedgeIndices(ofIndex: i)"},{"type":"text","text":" plus n, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n + p"},{"type":"text","text":" it is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"targetIndices(ofHyperedgeAt: p)"},{"type":"text","text":"; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"predecessorIndices"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inHyperedgeIndices"},{"type":"text","text":" plus n, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sourceIndices"},{"type":"text","text":". So graph algorithms run on the view without"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hashing a vertex. The view does not offer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_withSuccessorIndexRows"},{"type":"text","text":", whose contract needs edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"positions in row order."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Costs."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" As for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IncidenceGraphView"},{"type":"text","text":": O(1) reads on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IncidenceList"},{"type":"text","text":", which stores its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"incidences; on another base a hyperedge’s incidence numbers are a range, O(1), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"edges[q]"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"binary-searches and selects by rank, O(log m + ⌈n\/64⌉) on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":", and a vertex’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"outEdges"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"inEdges"},{"type":"text","text":" is computed from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"_memberRank"},{"type":"text","text":", O(d·⌈n\/64⌉) on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrientedIncidenceMatrix"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/DirectedIncidenceGraphView/base":{"url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/directedincidencegraphview\/base","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"base"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Base"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedIncidenceGraphView\/base","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"base","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The directed hypergraph."}]},"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs/DirectedIncidenceGraphView/outDegree(ofIndex:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"outDegree","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"ofIndex"